OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FRather
OL,6,Fcloudy in Shetland this evening and
OL,7,Fovernight, with scattered showers.
OL,8,FOrkney will see a mixture of clear
OL,9,Fspells and scattered showers. Fresh to
OL,10,Fstrong northwest winds.
OL,11,
OL,12,CMonday:FA bright and breezy day with
OL,13,Fsunny intervals and a scattering of
OL,14,Fshowers, becoming lighter and more
OL,15,Fisolated later in the day. Winds
OL,16,Feasing later.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
