OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:FA
OL,6,Fbreezy period with variable amounts of
OL,7,Fcloud and sunny spells. Dry on
OL,8,FTuesday, a few showery outbreaks of
OL,9,Frain on Wednesday and Thursday.
